we can check the pipe status by  using the command "${PIPESTATUS[*]}"


it is useful when we are dealing with the complex pipe lines like

cat /this-doesnt-exists | tr , : | grep emon | cat

then running PIPESTATUS command may show : 1 0 1 0

	1 = failure (false)
	0 = success (true)

note : pipe status shows about the last command
